 into x12, with no M-mode action (RVP-SUPERVISOR §11.1.1.12; RVP-SUPERVISOR §11.1.1.3).") (gpr_witness (step_n 175) (register "x12"))) (property (id "suppressed-stie-clear") (requirement_id "REQ-D-SSTC") (obligation_ids "OB-SSTC") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "Pending and SIE set, but sie.STIE clear: no trap, and this instruction retires in sequence, 77 into x13 (RVP-SUPERVISOR §11.1.1.3).") (gpr_witness (step_n 177) (register "x13"))) (property (id "suppressed-sie-clear") (requirement_id "REQ-D-SSTC") (obligation_ids "OB-SSTC") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "Pending and STIE set, but sstatus.SIE clear in S: no trap, and this instruction retires in sequence, 78 into x14 (RVP-SUPERVISOR §11.1.1.3).") (gpr_witness (step_n 181) (register "x14"))) (property (id "suppressed-delegated-in-m") (requirement_id "REQ-D-SSTC") (obligation_ids "OB-SSTC") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "Pending, MIE set and delegated: M does not take a delegated interrupt, and this instruction retires in sequence, 80 into x18 (RVP-MACHINE §2.1.1.8).") (gpr_witness (step_n 237) (register "x18"))) (property (id "m-still-pending") (requirement_id "REQ-D-SSTC") (obligation_ids "OB-SSTC") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "That suppression hid nothing: sip still reads 0x20 in M (RVP-SUPERVISOR §11.1.1.12).") (gpr_witness (step_n 239) (register "x19"))) (property (id "suppressed-stce-clear") (requirement_id "REQ-D-SSTC") (obligation_ids "OB-SSTC") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "With STCE clear, STIP reverts to its definition without the extension and nothing set it, so a compare of 0 no longer makes it pending: sip reads 0 (RVP-MACHINE §2.1.1.18).") (gpr_witness (step_n 313) (register "x12"))) (property (id "stce-clear-not-delivered") (requirement_id "REQ-D-SSTC") (obligation_ids "OB-SSTC") (observation_kinds "gpr-change") (statement "SIE and STIE set, STCE clear: nothing is pending, and this instruction retires in sequence, 83 into x13 